@startuml

title ComponentHub - Statistics and Purge Candidates

actor Cataloguer
participant "Statistics page\n(app.js)" as UI
participant "Catalogue client\n(catalogue.js)" as Client
participant "Express API" as API
database "SQLite" as DB

Cataloguer -> UI: Open Statistics page
UI -> Client: init()
Client --> UI: Cached catalogue
UI -> Client: request(GET /stats)
Client -> API: GET /api/stats\nAuthorization: JWT
API -> API: Authenticate and check Cataloguer role
API -> DB: Aggregate component, usage and category statistics
DB --> API: Statistics
API --> Client: Statistics
Client --> UI: Render charts and tables

Cataloguer -> UI: Set unused threshold
UI -> Client: purgeCandidates(threshold)
Client -> API: GET /api/stats/purge-candidates?threshold=n
API -> API: Authenticate and check Cataloguer role
API -> DB: Find components meeting usage threshold
DB --> API: Candidate components
API --> Client: Candidate list
Client --> UI: Render purge actions

Cataloguer -> UI: Confirm purge for candidate
UI -> Client: remove(componentId)
Client -> API: DELETE /api/components/{id}
API -> DB: Delete candidate component
DB --> API: Deletion complete
API --> Client: 204 No Content
Client -> Client: Remove component from cache
Client --> UI: Refresh statistics and candidates

alt Not authorized or request fails
  API --> Client: 401/403/500 error
  Client --> UI: Throw error
  UI --> Cataloguer: Show error
end
@enduml
